+# Feature Specification: Task timestamps
+
+**Created**: 2026-11-17 | **Status**: Implemented
+**Input**: "Record when each task was created and last changed."
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: Every task has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings; equal when added.
+- **FR-002**: complete, reopen, rename, tag, untag set `updatedAt` to the time of the change; `createdAt` never changes.
+- **FR-003**: A failed change leaves the task untouched.
+- **FR-004**: The domain reads no clock: `createTaskList(now)` receives it; `createTodoList({ now })` in `src/index.ts` defaults to the system clock.
+
+## Assumptions
+- A successful change that alters nothing (tagging an already-present tag) still sets `updatedAt`.
